Z||000020||DRH||09-13-2001||10:26 PM||||Mach10,<P>I guess I didn't make my point very well. I didn't mean they did it just because of the album. I was wondering if the album cover influenced people that were already planning SOMETHING to do it in a certain way. I agree, listening to Ozzy won't cause someone to kill themself... they might choose to listen to his CD while doing it though.<P>Since it's hard to believe Islamic fundamentalist listen to hip hop... now I'm beginning to wonder if it was the other way around. Maybe the cover was inspired by some knowledge of what was planned. <P>Before Tuesday, why would someone ever think to show BOTH towers exploding high in the air as if hit by a plane? Wouldn't previous experience lead most people to envision a ground explosion?<P>I guess the whole thing could be a hoax too. Does anybody on here remember seeing the cover BEFORE Tuesday?||||reg||1
